  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is therefore not a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;Notwithstanding the calculations annotated on the submitted plans, the\r\nproposed cubic content of the resulting roof space would exceed the cubic\r\ncontent of the original roof space by more than 50 cubic metres and is\r\ntherefore not within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1 Class B.1 (d) of The\r\nTown and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015\r\nas amended.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal has not demonstrated that the window to be inserted in the wall forming the side elevation of the dwellinghouse would be i) obscure-glazed, and ii) non-opening unless the parts of the window which can be opened are more than 1.7 metres above the floor of the room in which the window is installed. The proposed development would not therefore be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class B, B.2 (c) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
